:"2026-11-21T08:58Z","kind":"outage","what":"After Brotli copies of /data/*.json were switched on, the worker's own reads of /data/bali-cases.json got the compressed copy: every /api/open/* endpoint answered data_unavailable (08:47 to 08:53). For about 5 minutes after that fix, browsers got some JSON files compressed twice.","impact":"Open data API down for 6 minutes; some JSON downloads unreadable for about 5 more minutes. HTML pages stayed up.","fix":"Worker reads take the plain copy (9d9c5759c3), then Brotli copies switched off (35a21e3f9e). They stay off; a test header keeps the path testable.","commits":["9d9c5759c3","35a21e3f9e"],"source":"engineering notes, batch 34"},{"id":"2026-11-20-sitemaps-500","start":"2026-11-20T13:07Z","end":"2026-11-20T13:14Z","kind":"outage","what":"A trailing comment swallowed the rest of a line in the sitemap builder (\"T is not defined\"): /sitemap_index.xml, every /sitemaps/*.xml and /engineering/seo/ answered 500.","impact":"Sitemaps unavailable to search engines for about 7 minutes. Pages stayed up.","fix":"Line restored (13098cd3d2); all sitemaps 200 again with the same URL counts.","commits":["cdd3434416","13098cd3d2"],"source":"engineering notes, batch 33"},{"id":"2026-11-18-pages-size","start":"2026-11-18T13:18Z","end":"2026-11-18T14:10Z","kind":"deploy","what":"The edge worker directory passed the 25 MiB limit of Cloudflare Pages, so every build of the publishing branch failed (about 60 sites on that branch).","impact":"No new version could go live for about 50 minutes; visitors kept getting the previous version.","fix":"Large string tables moved out of the worker into static JSON (019b1a96b1, then batch 32 lowered the worker from 24.50 to 22.40 MiB); a size guard now stops a push above the limit.","commits":["329e7afcf7","019b1a96b1"],"source":"engineering notes, batches 31 and 32"},{"id":"2026-11-17-snapshot-chain","start":"2026-11-18T00:00Z","end":null,"kind":"data","what":"The daily dataset snapshot job stopped adding